        "c8": "7",
        "q4": "def add2(x): return x + 2. What is add2(add2(3))?",
        "c9": "15",
        "c10": "12",
        "c11": "13",
        "q5": "def times3(n): return n * 3. What is times3(4) + times3(1)?",
        "c12": "24",
        "q6": "def triangle(): repeat 3 times: forward 4, turn left. Program: repeat 2 times: triangle(). How many forward commands run?",
        "q7": "The function dance() has 3 moves. The program calls dance() 5 times. How many moves run?",
        "c13": "1",
        "q8": "def star(): show '*'. Program: repeat 4 times: star(). How many stars are shown?",
        "c14": "20",
        "c15": "10",
        "c16": "0",
        "q9": "score = 0. The function level_up() adds 10 to score. Program: level_up(); level_up(). What is score?",
